--- !u!114 &899452777
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 899452774}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 493b6a61b9ccb45849f97b680d7bd3b8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ReadableLetterPrefab: {fileID: 357051419617302282, guid: c3502e1fda52d4abda68014d249d3b8f, type: 3}
  collectedLetterHolder: {fileID: 2000063283}
  topLetter: {fileID: 0}
  bottomLetter: {fileID: 0}
  FallBackText: {fileID: 899224497}
  anim: {fileID: 899452776}
  LetterContents:
  - "    What do you remember about your mother? \n    I remember mine was warm."
  - "    I wish I were a bird,\n    so that I could fly away from everything, \n   
    and eventually become a part of nature."
  - '    Wo wu fa li jie da dajia, ye wu fa li jie wo zi ji'
  - "    It was a long time ago, when the world was still in that state. \n    She
    was once alive, and somehow mothers are always the ones who survived during those
    times. "
  - "   What does a train do \n   when it commits a crime?"
  - "    Is today nothing?\n    Is the beginningless past nothing?\r\n    If the
    future is nothing they are just as surely nothing."
  - "    Eu sinto saudades de panquecas. \n    Me pergunto se algum dia poderei com\xEA-las
    novamente."
  - "    She became a bird and flew away. \n    But we think she's happy, \n    and
    we hope to see her again. "
  - '    It covers its tracks!'
  - "    I made a drum set with all the things the adults no longer want. I am the
    richest person in the world now! \r\n"
  - "chugga chugga chugga chugga choo choo chugga chugga chugga chugga choo choo
    chugga chugga chugga chugga choo choo chugga chugga chugga chugga choo choo chugga
    chugga chugga chugga choo choo \r\n"
  - "    Thoughts come and go, making me realize who I am, then making me forget
    who I was a few seconds ago. \n    But at this very moment, my existence stays
    here forever. "
  - "    This place has no end, no life, and no time.\n    I have been thinking about
    apologizing to you since that day. \n    Memories are  getting blurry, but the
    shape of you and home remains."
  - "    It\u2019s never boring here. \n    We made our own games to spend  meaningful
    and meaningless fun time together. \n    I dream about playing games with you. 
    \r\n\n"
  - "    It feels like a long time since I wrote to you, my friend. \n    Life is
    as usual. \n    Don't forget me."
  assignmentCounter: 0
  gm: {fileID: 2006992966}
  Inventory: {fileID: 50650299}
  PanelImage: {fileID: 899452778}
  SingleLetter: {fileID: 1825665275}
  SingleLetterShown: 0
  bagOpen: 0
  uiManager: {fileID: 5065066327471323791}
